title: 'mc: Mail Composer - Email Composition and Delivery'
version: 0.3.0
abstract: Compose, draft, and send emails from markdown files via the Gmail API. Strips
  markdown headers, converts to HTML with inline table styles, appends a standard
  signature, and handles threading. Wraps gmailr to reduce email scripts from 80 lines
  of boilerplate to 3.
